  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairGroupDefaults>按身份默认显示头发</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairGroupDefaults>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairGroupTooltip>为这组未满 3 岁的婴幼儿显示已有发型。单人设置优先。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairGroupTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairIndividual>已加载地图上的婴幼儿</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairIndividual>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairIndividualDesc>单人设置随当前存档保存。显示头发会使用角色已有的发型。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairIndividualDesc>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairLoadGame>载入存档后，可以逐个设置婴幼儿的头发。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairLoadGame>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairNoBabies>已加载的地图上没有婴幼儿。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_HairNoBabies>
