  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MapExit>离图</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MapExit>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AllowMapExit>允许婴幼儿自行走出地图</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AllowMapExit>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AllowMapExitTooltip>允许这组婴幼儿在无事可做或与队伍走散时自行走向出口。设置影响新任务。释放、玩家指令和队伍按原定职责撤离照常生效。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AllowMapExitTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SupplyFood>提供食物补给</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SupplyFood>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SupplyFoodTooltip>符合条件的婴幼儿进入殖民地地图或随旅行队伍生成时会获得食物。非殖民者限非敌对派系。随行儿童也可能获得便携口粮。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_SupplyFoodTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedWhileCarried>背负时自动喂食</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedWhileCarried>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedWhileCarriedTooltip>在殖民地地图上，这组被背负的婴幼儿饥饿时，会消耗自己或背负者随身携带的婴儿食物。非殖民者限非敌对派系。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedWhileCarriedTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedInCaravan>玩家商队协助喂食</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedInCaravan>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedInCaravanTooltip>这组幼儿饿了又还没学会自己吃饭时，玩家商队会用随队携带的婴儿食物喂他们。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FeedInCaravanTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MidnightSnacks>偷吃零食</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MidnightSnacks>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MidnightSnacksTooltip>殖民地的幼儿和儿童在特定时段闲下来时，可能会偷吃零食。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_MidnightSnacksTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AutomaticToddlerBathing>幼儿自动洗澡</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AutomaticToddlerBathing>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AutomaticToddlerBathingTooltip>启用 Dubs Bad Hygiene 后，符合条件的幼儿会自己找地方洗澡。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_AutomaticToddlerBathingTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NatureRunningFollowers>跟上自然奔跑的孩子</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NatureRunningFollowers>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NatureRunningFollowersTooltip>孩子开始自然奔跑时，附近的幼儿和儿童可能会跟上。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NatureRunningFollowersTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_BabyCarryDesire>婴幼儿主动求抱</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_BabyCarryDesire>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_BabyCarryDesireTooltip>殖民地的婴幼儿有时会哭着求抱，附近的照料者可以前去抱起他们。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_BabyCarryDesireTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FamilyBedroomThoughts>婴幼儿与家人的同房心情</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FamilyBedroomThoughts>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FamilyBedroomThoughtsTooltip>根据同房睡觉的人，为婴幼儿及家人应用本模组的卧室心情效果。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FamilyBedroomThoughtsTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FriendlyBabyAdoption>收养友方婴儿</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FriendlyBabyAdoption>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FriendlyBabyAdoptionTooltip>允许收养来自非敌对派系、未满一岁的婴儿。囚犯仍按通常方式招募。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_FriendlyBabyAdoptionTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_IgnoreBabyStripGoodwill>剥下婴幼儿衣物时保留派系好感</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_IgnoreBabyStripGoodwill>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_IgnoreBabyStripGoodwillTooltip>剥下婴幼儿的衣物时，保留其派系对你的好感。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_IgnoreBabyStripGoodwillTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_KiiroRefugeeProtection>留住绮罗委托孤儿</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_KiiroRefugeeProtection>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_KiiroRefugeeProtectionTooltip>以后遇到绮罗委托孤儿事件时，婴儿会暂时昏倒，留在原地等候收养。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_KiiroRefugeeProtectionTooltip>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonBlockingBabyFits>哭笑时仍可参与活动</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonBlockingBabyFits>
  <RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonBlockingBabyFitsTooltip>婴幼儿哭泣或咯咯笑时，仍有资格参与玩耍及部分群体活动，也能留在运输工具内。</RimTalk_ToddlersExpansion_YoungPawn_NonBlockingBabyFitsTooltip>
</LanguageData>
